<title>FRANCE: Bongrain H1 97 sales up 5.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Bongrain H1 97 sales up 5.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				    5,300</p>
<p>NOTE - Bongrain SA gave the results in a statement. It said that on a like-for-like basis with stable exchange rates, sales rose 2.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
